{"id":"00021","root":"uni00021_1","name":{"ja":"リーナ","en":"Lina"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"リーナ","en":"Lina"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Nomad"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":21,"profile":{"ja":"ノマドの騎士軍に所属する騎士。イングリッドなどには遠く及ばないが日々訓練をし実戦に赴いたことにより彼女自身の力が目覚めつつあり、その力の一角が現れはじめ日々その力は強くなっていっている。幾多の戦場を経てヘタレであったり見栄っ張りなところがダメであると気づき、努力して行ったのである。いくつもの戦場を駆けて勝利を収めていくうち、彼女の存在はイングリッドたちの目にも止まり、『嵐騎』の二つ名を授かっている。彼女が目覚めた力が風を操る力でその力は並の力ではない事から嵐の文字を宛がわれた騎士ということで嵐騎の名を与えられた。","en":"Lina is a knight serving in the Nomad Knight Corps. Though she can't yet match Ingrid and the like, she trains daily, and by taking part in real battles her own power is beginning to awaken, with a fragment of that power already emerging and growing stronger each day. After countless battlefields she realized that her cowardice and show-off attitude were holding her back, so she worked hard to change. As she raced across many fields and claimed victory after victory, her presence caught Ingrid's eye, and she earned the epithet \"Storm Rider.\" The power she awakened lets her command the wind, a talent far beyond ordinary strength, so she was given the name Storm Rider as a knight who bears the mark of the storm."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"烏丸そら","forms":[{"id":"uni00021_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[982,1964],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[134,268],"def":[117,234],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","61"]},{"id":"uni00021_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1464,2928],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[203,406],"def":[169,338],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","61","62"]},{"id":"uni00021_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1946,3892],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[277,554],"def":[226,452],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","61","62"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels